            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Three hundred and nine patients complaining of cervical, dorsal or lumbar pain or sciatica were explored by digital subtraction epidurography then treated with local steroids. This treatment was very efficient with 5% failure. Only 19% of the herniated discs required surgery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
